ed_blackbird\", \"iconic_taxon_id\": 3, \"iconic_taxon_name\": \"Aves\", \"observations_count\": 259421, \"english_common_name\": \"Red-winged Blackbird\", \"taxon_changes_count\": 1, \"taxon_schemes_count\": 9, \"preferred_common_name\": \"Tordo sargento\", \"complete_species_count\": null, \"current_synonymous_taxon_ids\": null}, \"taxon_id\": 9744}], \"complete_rank\": \"subspecies\", \"default_photo\": {\"id\": 368048127, \"url\": \"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/368048127/square.jpg\", \"flags\": [], \"medium_url\": \"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/368048127/medium.jpg\", \"square_url\": \"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/368048127/square.jpg\", \"attribution\": \"(c) sdrov, all rights reserved, uploaded by sdrov\", \"license_code\": null, \"attribution_name\": \"sdrov\", \"original_dimensions\": {\"width\": 2048, \"height\": 1365}}, \"photos_locked\": false, \"wikipedia_url\": null, \"iconic_taxon_id\": 3, \"iconic_taxon_name\": \"Aves\", \"listed_taxa_count\": 91, \"wikipedia_summary\": \"El <b>tordo sargento</b> (<i><b>Agelaius phoeniceus</b></i>), también conocido como <b>sargento</b>,<b>tordo alirrojo</b>,<b>tordo capitán</b> o <b>turpial alirrojo</b>, es un ave de hábitos migratorios perteneciente a la familia de los ictéridos, dentro del orden de los paseriformes. Habita en zonas húmedas y terrenos de cultivo de América del Norte y Central. Presenta un marcado dimorfismo sexual vinculado a una sensible diferencia en su tamaño y al color del plumaje, que se manifiesta a temprana edad. Las hembras son principalmente marrones...\", \"observations_count\": 259421, \"conservation_status\": null, \"english_common_name\": \"Red-winged Blackbird\", \"taxon_changes_count\": 1, \"taxon_schemes_count\": 9, \"conservation_statuses\": [{\"id\": 100677, \"url\": \"https://explorer.natureserve.org/Taxon/ELEMENT_GLOBAL.2.102734\", \"iucn\": 50, \"place\": {\"id\": 7289, \"name\": \"Newfoundland and Labrador\", \"admin_level\": 10, \"display_name\": \"