iliso</b>, <b>anó chico</b>, <b>pirincho negro chico</b>, <b>tijuíl pico liso</b>, y <b>vacamuchacho</b> (en la Amazonía peruana), es una especie de ave cuculiforme de la familia Cuculidae propia de América donde se distribuye desde Florida a través de las Antillas hasta Trinidad y Tobago, y desde Costa Rica hasta el norte de Argentina, pasando por Brasil, Colombia, Ecuador y el Perú. No se conocen subespecies.\", \"observations_count\": 14970, \"conservation_status\": null, \"english_common_name\": \"Garrapatero pico liso\", \"establishment_means\": {\"id\": 211565, \"place\": {\"id\": 7196, \"name\": \"Colombia\", \"ancestry\": \"97389\", \"display_name\": \"Colombia\"}, \"establishment_means\": \"native\"}, \"taxon_changes_count\": 0, \"taxon_schemes_count\": 9, \"conservation_statuses\": [{\"id\": 526, \"url\": \"https://www.iucnredlist.org/species/22684434/168903230\", \"iucn\": 10, \"place\": null, \"status\": \"LC\", \"taxon_id\": 1971, \"authority\": \"IUCN Red List\", \"source_id\": 18766, \"created_at\": \"2013-02-16T00:50:27+00:00\", \"geoprivacy\": null, \"taxon_name\": \"Crotophaga ani\", \"taxon_rank\": \"species\", \"updated_at\": \"2021-09-22T08:30:10+00:00\", \"updater_id\": null, \"description\": \"\"}, {\"id\": 488405, \"url\": \"https://explorer.natureserve.org/Taxon/ELEMENT_GLOBAL.2.102852/Crotophaga_ani\", \"iucn\": 30, \"user\": {\"id\": 4960246, \"login\": \"dum1\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"place\": {\"id\": 21, \"name\": \"Florida\", \"admin_level\": 10, \"display_name\": \"Florida, US\", \"ancestor_place_ids\": [97394, 1, 21]}, \"status\": \"VU\", \"updater\": {\"id\": 4960246, \"login\": \"dum1\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"taxon_id\": 1971, \"authority\": \"NatureServe\", \"source_id\": null, \"created_at\": \"2025-04-07T17:34:53+00:00\", \"geoprivacy\": \"open\", \"taxon_name\": \"Crotophaga ani\", \"taxon_rank\": \"species\", \"updated_at\": \"2025-04-07T17:34:53+00:00\", \"updater_id\": 4960246, \"descriptio