48, \"height\": 1365}}, \"photos_locked\": false, \"wikipedia_url\": null, \"iconic_taxon_id\": 26036, \"iconic_taxon_name\": \"Reptilia\", \"listed_taxa_count\": 4, \"wikipedia_summary\": \"La <b>terciopelo</b> (<i><b>Bothrops asper</b></i>) es una especie de serpiente crotalina venenosa que se encuentra en América Central y el norte de Sudamérica. Se halla en un amplio rango de hábitats de tierras bajas, a menudo cerca de asentamientos humanos. Es una especie grande y nerviosa, y es la principal responsable de incidentes por mordeduras de serpiente dentro de su zona de distribución. No se reconocen subespecies actualmente.\", \"observations_count\": 7060, \"conservation_status\": null, \"english_common_name\": \"Talla equis\", \"establishment_means\": {\"id\": 58508, \"place\": {\"id\": 7196, \"name\": \"Colombia\", \"ancestry\": \"97389\", \"display_name\": \"Colombia\"}, \"establishment_means\": \"native\"}, \"taxon_changes_count\": 0, \"taxon_schemes_count\": 3, \"conservation_statuses\": [{\"id\": 268582, \"url\": \"https://www.iucnredlist.org/species/197464/2486766\", \"iucn\": 10, \"place\": null, \"status\": \"LC\", \"taxon_id\": 30798, \"authority\": \"IUCN Red List\", \"source_id\": null, \"created_at\": \"2022-11-03T20:28:13+00:00\", \"geoprivacy\": \"open\", \"taxon_name\": \"Bothrops asper\", \"taxon_rank\": \"species\", \"updated_at\": \"2022-11-03T20:28:13+00:00\", \"updater_id\": null, \"description\": null}], \"preferred_common_name\": \"Talla equis\", \"complete_species_count\": null, \"current_synonymous_taxon_ids\": null, \"preferred_establishment_means\": \"native\"}], \"per_page\": 30, \"total_results\": 1}', NULL, '2025-12-16 20:44:20', '2025-12-15 21:35:09', 1, '2025-12-15 20:44:20', '2025-12-15 21:35:09'),
