upicola rupicola</i>) y es notable por la increíble belleza de su plumaje. Su forma exótica es muy popular, pues su figura ha sido plasmada en grabados, pinturas y fotografías que se publican por doquier....\", \"observations_count\": 2567, \"conservation_status\": {\"id\": 139965, \"url\": \"http://www.cites.org/eng/resources/species.html\", \"iucn\": 40, \"user\": {\"id\": 477, \"login\": \"loarie\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"place\": null, \"status\": \"Appendix II\", \"updater\": {\"id\": 477, \"login\": \"loarie\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"taxon_id\": 8877, \"authority\": \"CITES\", \"source_id\": null, \"created_at\": \"2018-03-16T03:39:36+00:00\", \"geoprivacy\": \"obscured\", \"taxon_name\": \"Rupicola peruvianus\", \"taxon_rank\": \"species\", \"updated_at\": \"2018-03-16T03:39:36+00:00\", \"updater_id\": 477, \"description\": null}, \"english_common_name\": \"Andean Cock-of-the-rock\", \"establishment_means\": {\"id\": 212066, \"place\": {\"id\": 7196, \"name\": \"Colombia\", \"ancestry\": \"97389\", \"display_name\": \"Colombia\"}, \"establishment_means\": \"native\"}, \"taxon_changes_count\": 0, \"taxon_schemes_count\": 7, \"conservation_statuses\": [{\"id\": 139965, \"url\": \"http://www.cites.org/eng/resources/species.html\", \"iucn\": 40, \"user\": {\"id\": 477, \"login\": \"loarie\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"place\": null, \"status\": \"Appendix II\", \"updater\": {\"id\": 477, \"login\": \"loarie\", \"orcid\": null, \"icon_url\": null}, \"taxon_id\": 8877, \"authority\": \"CITES\", \"source_id\": null, \"created_at\": \"2018-03-16T03:39:36+00:00\", \"geoprivacy\": \"obscured\", \"taxon_name\": \"Rupicola peruvianus\", \"taxon_rank\": \"species\", \"updated_at\": \"2018-03-16T03:39:36+00:00\", \"updater_id\": 477, \"description\": null}, {\"id\": 3504, \"url\": \"https://www.iucnredlist.org/species/22700974/130267257\", \"iucn\": 10, \"place\": null, \"status\": \"LC\", \"taxon_id\": 8877, \"authority\": \"